{"task_id": "HumanEval/99", "solution": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_FLOOR, ROUND_CEILING\n\ndef closest_integer(value):\n    '''\n    Returns the closest integer to a numeric string, rounding away from zero on ties.\n    '''\n    num = Decimal(value.strip())\n\n    floor_val = num.to_integral_value(rounding=ROUND_FLOOR)\n    ceil_val = num.to_integral_value(rounding=ROUND_CEILING)\n\n    floor_int = int(floor_val)\n    ceil_int = int(ceil_val)\n\n    if floor_val == num: # If num is already an exact integer\n        return floor_int\n\n    dist_to_floor = abs(num - floor_val)\n    dist_to_ceil = abs(num - ceil_val)\n\n    if dist_to_floor < dist_to_ceil:\n        return floor_int\n    elif dist_to_ceil < dist_to_floor:\n        return ceil_int\n    else: # Equidistant (tie), round away from zero\n        return ceil_int if num >= 0 else floor_int"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/99", "solution": "from decimal import Decimal\n\ndef closest_integer(value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the closest integer to the given string value,\n    rounding away from zero for equidistant numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    decimal_value = Decimal(value)\n\n    sign = 1 if decimal_value >= 0 else -1\n    abs_value = abs(decimal_value)\n\n    integer_part = abs_value.to_integral_value(rounding=\"ROUND_FLOOR\")\n    fractional_part = abs_value - integer_part\n\n    half = Decimal(\"0.5\")\n\n    if fractional_part >= half:\n        rounded_abs_integer = int(integer_part) + 1\n    else:\n        rounded_abs_integer = int(integer_part)\n\n    return sign * rounded_abs_integer"}
