{"task_id": "HumanEval/150", "solution": "def x_or_y(n, x, y):\n    \"\"\"Returns x if n is a prime number, otherwise returns y.\"\"\"\n\n    # Implement the primality test logic directly as described in the design context.\n    if n < 2:\n        is_n_prime = False\n    elif n in (2, 3):\n        is_n_prime = True\n    elif n % 2 == 0:\n        is_n_prime = False\n    else:\n        is_n_prime = True\n        r = int(n**0.5)\n        i = 3\n        while i <= r:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                is_n_prime = False\n                break\n            i += 2\n            \n    if is_n_prime:\n        return x\n    else:\n        return y"}
